  "task_assistant_messages": [
    "Of the 100 fourth-graders, \\(100-45=55\\) failed, so \\(55\\%\\) of the fourth-graders failed.\n\nHowever, no information is provided about the number of fifth-graders or how many of them failed. Therefore, the combined percentage cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined from the information given}}\n\\]",
    "1. Fourth-graders who failed:\n\\[\n100-40=60\n\\]\nSo, \\(60\\%\\) of fourth-graders failed.\n\n2. No information is given about the fifth-graders’ test results.\n\nTherefore, the combined percentage of fourth- and fifth-graders who failed cannot be determined.\n\n\\[\n\\boxed{\\text{Cannot be determined from the information given}}\n\\]",
